<title>USA: Pre-Paid Legal adds 52,414 members in Q4.</title>
<headline>Pre-Paid Legal adds 52,414 members in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>ADA, Okla. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pre-Paid Legal Services Inc said Wednesday it added 52,414 new members in the fourth quarter, up 52 percent from the 34,453 new members it gained in the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>The company said 194,843 members were added during 1996, an increase of 77 percent from the new members gained in 1995.</p>
<p>Earlier, Pre-Paid reported fourth quarter earnings of $0.16 a share, up from $0.10 a year ago.</p>
<p>Pre-Paid Legal develops, underwrites and markets legal service plans nationally.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
